# Per-machine tool settings. `launch.json` is shared on purpose - it is how a
# contributor starts the visual harness - but `settings.local.json` is exactly
# what its name says, and committing one person's permission allowlist would
# quietly hand it to everyone who clones.
.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/settings.local.json

